.TH CRUNCH_MQ_TIMEDRECEIVE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_mq_timedreceive \- Linux x86-64 syscall 243
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B ssize_t crunch_mq_timedreceive(int queue, char* message, size_t length, unsigned int* priority, const struct timespec* timeout);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Receives a POSIX message using an optional absolute timeout.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mq_timedreceive (2)
